 "turns": [
  {
   "turn_id": "C21-D001",
   "turn_index": 0,
   "speaker": "原田",
   "source_text": "はい、みなみ市民会館です。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C21-D001-S01"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-8",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 0.0,
   "end_sec": 1.802,
   "duration_sec": 1.802
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C21-D002",
   "turn_index": 1,
   "speaker": "アミナ",
   "source_text": "おはようございます。料理教室のボランティアのアミナです。原田さんはいますか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C21-D002-S01",
    "C21-D002-S02",
    "C21-D002-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-storyteller-1",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 2.152,
   "end_sec": 7.852,
   "duration_sec": 5.7
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C21-D003",
   "turn_index": 2,
   "speaker": "原田",
   "source_text": "はい、原田です。アミナさん、おはようございます。先ほど、日程変更のメールを送りました。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C21-D003-S01",
    "C21-D003-S02",
    "C21-D003-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-8",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 8.202,
   "end_sec": 14.26,
   "duration_sec": 6.058
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C21-D004",
   "turn_index": 3,
   "speaker": "アミナ",
   "source_text": "ありがとうございます。昨日、会館でお知らせを読みました。オーブンが故障したんですね。修理は数日かかりますか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C21-D004-S01",
    "C21-D004-S02",
    "C21-D004-S03",
    "C21-D004-S04"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-storyteller-1",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 14.61,
   "end_sec": 23.576,
   "duration_sec": 8.966
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C21-D005",
   "turn_index": 4,
   "speaker": "原田",
   "source_text": "ええ、昨日の朝、急に故障したんです。工事は6日から10日までです。それで、4日の教室は延期します。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C21-D005-S01",
    "C21-D005-S02",
    "C21-D005-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-8",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 23.926,
   "end_sec": 32.005,
   "duration_sec": 8.079
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C21-D006",
   "turn_index": 5,
   "speaker": "アミナ",
   "source_text": "再来週の18日は土曜日ですね。11日も土曜日ですが、11日は無理ですか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C21-D006-S01",
    "C21-D006-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-storyteller-1",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 32.355,
   "end_sec": 39.266,
   "duration_sec": 6.911
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C21-D007",
   "turn_index": 6,
   "speaker": "原田",
   "source_text": "はい。18日に延期したのは、11日は別の人が教室を使うからです。18日の時間は10時から12時までです。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C21-D007-S01",
    "C21-D007-S02",
    "C21-D007-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-8",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 39.616,
   "end_sec": 48.203,
   "duration_sec": 8.587
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C21-D008",
   "turn_index": 7,
   "speaker": "アミナ",
   "source_text": "なるほど。実は、18日は都合がよくないんです。前から用事があります。18日は欠席してもいいですか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C21-D008-S01",
    "C21-D008-S02",
    "C21-D008-S03",
    "C21-D008-S04"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-storyteller-1",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 48.553,
   "end_sec": 57.529,
   "duration_sec": 8.976
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C21-D009",
   "turn_index": 8,
   "speaker": "原田",
   "source_text": "そうですか。急用ですか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C21-D009-S01",
    "C21-D009-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-8",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 57.879,
   "end_sec": 59.943,
   "duration_sec": 2.064
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C21-D010",
   "turn_index": 9,
   "speaker": "アミナ",
   "source_text": "いいえ。友だちが休暇で来るんです。遠い所に住んでいます。年末は出張なので、7月の中頃に会う約束です。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C21-D010-S01",
    "C21-D010-S02",
    "C21-D010-S03",
    "C21-D010-S04"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-storyteller-1",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 60.293,
   "end_sec": 69.125,
   "duration_sec": 8.832
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C21-D011",
   "turn_index": 10,
   "speaker": "原田",
   "source_text": "そうですか。18日は子どもが12人来ます。石井さんとアミナさんが手伝う予定でした。代わりの人はいますか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C21-D011-S01",
    "C21-D011-S02",
    "C21-D011-S03",
    "C21-D011-S04"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-8",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 69.475,
   "end_sec": 78.145,
   "duration_sec": 8.67
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C21-D012",
   "turn_index": 11,
   "speaker": "アミナ",
   "source_text": "まだいません。本当に申し訳ないです。代わりに17日に準備を手伝いたいんですが。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C21-D012-S01",
    "C21-D012-S02",
    "C21-D012-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-storyteller-1",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 78.495,
   "end_sec": 85.246,
   "duration_sec": 6.751
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C21-D013",
   "turn_index": 12,
   "speaker": "原田",
   "source_text": "19日ですか。19日は日曜日ですね。教室は18日なので、準備はその前です。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C21-D013-S01",
    "C21-D013-S02",
    "C21-D013-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-8",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 85.596,
   "end_sec": 94.427,
   "duration_sec": 8.831
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C21-D014",
   "turn_index": 13,
   "speaker": "アミナ",
   "source_text": "いいえ、じゅうしちにち、17日です。金曜日です。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C21-D014-S01",
    "C21-D014-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-storyteller-1",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 94.777,
   "end_sec": 99.067,
   "duration_sec": 4.29
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C21-D015",
   "turn_index": 14,
   "speaker": "原田",
   "source_text": "あっ、19日と勘違いしました。17日ですね。午後3時から、それとも夕方がいいですか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C21-D015-S01",
    "C21-D015-S02",
    "C21-D015-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-8",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 99.417,
   "end_sec": 107.639,
   "duration_sec": 8.222
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C21-D016",
   "turn_index": 15,
   "speaker": "アミナ",
   "source_text": "17日は5時まで働くので、3時は無理です。その日は残業がありません。5時半には間に合います。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C21-D016-S01",
    "C21-D016-S02",
    "C21-D016-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-storyteller-1",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 107.989,
   "end_sec": 116.326,
   "duration_sec": 8.337
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C21-D017",
   "turn_index": 16,
   "speaker": "原田",
   "source_text": "すみませんが、しばらく待ってください。予定を見ます。……はい、17日は私も5時半から7時半まで会館にいます。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C21-D017-S01",
    "C21-D017-S02",
    "C21-D017-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-8",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 116.676,
   "end_sec": 125.821,
   "duration_sec": 9.145
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C21-D018",
   "turn_index": 17,
   "speaker": "アミナ",
   "source_text": "ありがとうございます。準備は2時間ぐらいですか。7時半までは大丈夫です。8時に別の用があるので、7時半に終わってください。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C21-D018-S01",
    "C21-D018-S02",
    "C21-D018-S03",
    "C21-D018-S04"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-storyteller-1",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 126.171,
   "end_sec": 136.33,
   "duration_sec": 10.159
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C21-D019",
   "turn_index": 18,
   "speaker": "原田",
   "source_text": "はい、2時間ぐらいです。準備の時間は延ばしません。18日は休んでもいいです。代わりの人は私が探します。10日の金曜日にもう一度連絡します。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C21-D019-S01",
    "C21-D019-S02",
    "C21-D019-S03",
    "C21-D019-S04",
    "C21-D019-S05"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-8",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 136.68,
   "end_sec": 148.972,
   "duration_sec": 12.292
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C21-D026",
   "turn_index": 19,
   "speaker": "アミナ",
   "source_text": "17日は料理も作りますか。2回目の手伝いなので、準備の内容が気がかりです。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C21-D026-S01",
    "C21-D026-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-storyteller-1",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 149.322,
   "end_sec": 155.961,
   "duration_sec": 6.639
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C21-D027",
   "turn_index": 20,
   "speaker": "原田",
   "source_text": "料理は18日です。17日は机や椅子の準備をします。子ども用の椅子は、部屋の中頃に置きましょう。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C21-D027-S01",
    "C21-D027-S02",
    "C21-D027-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-8",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 156.311,
   "end_sec": 164.789,
   "duration_sec": 8.478
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C21-D028",
   "turn_index": 21,
   "speaker": "アミナ",
   "source_text": "はい。机と椅子の準備は石井さんと相談してもいいですか。私の代わりに18日の説明もお願いします。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C21-D028-S01",
    "C21-D028-S02",
    "C21-D028-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-storyteller-1",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 165.139,
   "end_sec": 173.503,
   "duration_sec": 8.364
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C21-D029",
   "turn_index": 22,
   "speaker": "原田",
   "source_text": "はい、石井さんに伝えます。準備の後で、お茶でも飲みましょう。数分、休んでも大丈夫です。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C21-D029-S01",
    "C21-D029-S02",
    "C21-D029-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-8",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 173.853,
   "end_sec": 179.957,
   "duration_sec": 6.104
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C21-D020",
   "turn_index": 23,
   "speaker": "アミナ",
   "source_text": "ありがとうございます。もう一人の予定は、何かとかち合っていますか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C21-D020-S01",
    "C21-D020-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-storyteller-1",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 180.307,
   "end_sec": 185.438,
   "duration_sec": 5.131
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C21-D021",
   "turn_index": 24,
   "speaker": "原田",
   "source_text": "それが、まだ返事がありません。石井さんは「日程の変更を了承しました」と言いました。もう一人には私が連絡します。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C21-D021-S01",
    "C21-D021-S02",
    "C21-D021-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-8",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 185.788,
   "end_sec": 194.169,
   "duration_sec": 8.381
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C21-D022",
   "turn_index": 25,
   "speaker": "アミナ",
   "source_text": "ありがとうございます。面倒なお願いですみません。私は17日の5時半から7時半まで準備を手伝います。18日は休みます。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C21-D022-S01",
    "C21-D022-S02",
    "C21-D022-S03",
    "C21-D022-S04"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-storyteller-1",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 194.519,
   "end_sec": 203.918,
   "duration_sec": 9.399
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C21-D023",
   "turn_index": 26,
   "speaker": "原田",
   "source_text": "はい。「17日の準備、18日のお休み、承知しました」とメールにも書きます。8月1日は都合がいいですか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C21-D023-S01",
    "C21-D023-S02",
    "C21-D023-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-8",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 204.268,
   "end_sec": 213.256,
   "duration_sec": 8.988
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C21-D024",
   "turn_index": 27,
   "speaker": "アミナ",
   "source_text": "はい、8月1日は来ます。そろそろ仕事なので、失礼します。10日の連絡を待っています。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C21-D024-S01",
    "C21-D024-S02",
    "C21-D024-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-storyteller-1",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 213.606,
   "end_sec": 220.584,
   "duration_sec": 6.978
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C21-D025",
   "turn_index": 28,
   "speaker": "原田",
   "source_text": "ありがとうございます。では、17日にお願いします。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C21-D025-S01",
    "C21-D025-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-8",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 220.934,
   "end_sec": 223.958,
   "duration_sec": 3.024
  }
 ],
 "sentence_intervals": [
